{"seq":2,"slug":"snapshots-replay","title":"快照与重放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/event-sourcing-cqrs/infrastructure/snapshots-replay","wordCount":1581,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"快照与重放\">快照与重放</h1><p>一个上线三年的热门账户，事件流里躺着八万条事件。每次它收到一条新命令，命令处理器都要把这八万条从头折叠一遍才能拿到当前状态——这显然不可持续。快照就是为此而生：把折叠到某个版本的中间状态缓存下来，下次从快照接着折叠剩下的几条增量，把加载从&quot;重放八万条&quot;压缩到&quot;重放几条&quot;。但快照一旦被当成&quot;另一份真相&quot;来用，就会埋下最隐蔽的 bug。这一篇讲快照的本质、何时拍快照、以及如何让快照与聚合演进和平共处。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>重放（Replay）是事件溯源加载状态的根本动作：对一条 stream 从头执行 <code>apply</code> 折叠，得到当前状态。<a href=\"../foundations/events-vs-state\">事件与状态的对偶</a> 已经证明，加载状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_n = \\mathrm{fold}(\\delta, S_0, [e_1..e_n])</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">fold</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">..</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">])</span></span></span></span></span>。快照（Snapshot）就是把这个折叠的某个中间结果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 存下来，于是加载变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_n = \\mathrm{fold}(\\delta, S_k, [e_{k+1}..e_n])</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">fold</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">..</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">])</span></span></span></span></span>——只重放快照之后的增量。</p>\n<p>这里有一条不可动摇的纪律，几乎所有快照 bug 都源于违反它：<strong>快照是缓存，不是真相。</strong> 真相永远是事件流；快照可以随时被删除、并从事件重新计算出来，且重算结果必须与快照一致。下表对比有无快照的加载代价：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>加载读取量</th>\n<th>折叠次数</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量重放</td>\n<td>整条 stream</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>短流（事件少）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快照 + 增量</td>\n<td>1 个快照 + 增量事件</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n - k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>长流（事件多）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>下图是带快照的加载路径——注意快照命中后只读增量，且快照本身随时可被丢弃重建：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  LOAD[加载聚合 account-42] --&gt; Q{有有效快照?}&#10;  Q -- 否 --&gt; FULL[从 v0 全量重放&lt;br/&gt;折叠全部事件]&#10;  Q -- 是 --&gt; SNAP[载入快照 状态@v_k]&#10;  SNAP --&gt; VALID{快照版本兼容当前代码?}&#10;  VALID -- 否 --&gt; DROP[丢弃快照&lt;br/&gt;退回全量重放]&#10;  VALID -- 是 --&gt; DELTA[只重放 v_k+1 之后的增量]&#10;  FULL --&gt; STATE[当前状态]&#10;  DROP --&gt; FULL&#10;  DELTA --&gt; STATE\">flowchart TD\n  LOAD[加载聚合 account-42] --&gt; Q{有有效快照?}\n  Q -- 否 --&gt; FULL[从 v0 全量重放&lt;br/&gt;折叠全部事件]\n  Q -- 是 --&gt; SNAP[载入快照 状态@v_k]\n  SNAP --&gt; VALID{快照版本兼容当前代码?}\n  VALID -- 否 --&gt; DROP[丢弃快照&lt;br/&gt;退回全量重放]\n  VALID -- 是 --&gt; DELTA[只重放 v_k+1 之后的增量]\n  FULL --&gt; STATE[当前状态]\n  DROP --&gt; FULL\n  DELTA --&gt; STATE</pre><h2 id=\"何时拍快照\">何时拍快照</h2><p>快照不是越多越好——拍快照本身有成本，过期快照还占空间。常见的触发策略有几种。<strong>按事件数阈值</strong>：每隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 条事件拍一次（如每 100 条），简单可控，是最常用的策略。<strong>按重放耗时阈值</strong>：一个实践经验法则是当重放时间超过约 100ms 就该考虑引入快照（<a href=\"https://letsbuildsolutions.com/blog/system-design/event-sourcing-in-practice-building-an-append-only-event-store-with-projections-and-snapshots/\">letsbuildsolutions.com</a>）。<strong>按访问频率</strong>：只给热点聚合拍，冷门聚合全量重放也不慢，省下快照维护成本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"SNAPSHOT_EVERY = 100&#10;&#10;def maybe_snapshot(aggregate, store):&#10;    # 距上次快照已积累足够多事件, 才拍新快照&#10;    events_since = aggregate.version - store.last_snapshot_version(aggregate.id)&#10;    if events_since &gt;= SNAPSHOT_EVERY:&#10;        store.save_snapshot(&#10;            aggregate.id,&#10;            version=aggregate.version,         # 关键: 记下快照对应的版本&#10;            state=serialize(aggregate),&#10;            schema_version=CURRENT_SCHEMA_VER,  # 关键: 记下聚合结构版本&#10;        )\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SNAPSHOT_EVERY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maybe_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(aggregate, store):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 距上次快照已积累足够多事件, 才拍新快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    events_since </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aggregate.version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> store.last_snapshot_version(aggregate.id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events_since </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SNAPSHOT_EVERY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        store.save_snapshot(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            aggregate.id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">aggregate.version,         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 关键: 记下快照对应的版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">serialize(aggregate),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            schema_version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CURRENT_SCHEMA_VER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 关键: 记下聚合结构版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意快照必须记两个版本号：<strong>事件版本</strong>（快照对应到 stream 的哪个 position，决定从哪开始读增量）和<strong>聚合结构版本</strong>（这个状态是用哪版聚合代码序列化的，决定快照还能不能被反序列化）。漏掉后者是快照最常见的坑，下一节细说。多数情况下快照可以异步生成，不必卡在命令处理的关键路径上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"快照与聚合演进\">快照与聚合演进</h2><p>聚合的状态结构会随业务变化——加个字段、改个含义、重构内部结构。这时旧快照怎么办？因为快照只是缓存，答案出奇地干净：<strong>结构变了，旧快照直接作废，从事件重算即可。</strong> 这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/events-vs-state\">事件与状态的对偶</a> 里&quot;快照可丢弃重算、无需迁移脚本&quot;的实践兑现，也是它和 <a href=\"../modeling/event-design-versioning\">事件设计与版本演进</a> 里&quot;事件不可重写、必须 upcast&quot;的鲜明对比——事件演进难，快照演进易，因为前者是真相、后者是缓存。</p>\n<p>实现上靠那个 <code>schema_version</code>：加载时若快照的结构版本与当前聚合代码不符，就丢弃这个快照、退回全量重放（图里的 DROP 分支）。这意味着部署一个改了聚合结构的新版本后，热点聚合会经历一次&quot;快照失效、全量重放、重新拍快照&quot;的回暖期，性能短暂回落但完全正确。千万不要为了省这次重放而去&quot;迁移旧快照&quot;——那等于把缓存当真相维护，是事件溯源里最反模式的操作之一。一个稳妥做法是：新版本上线后让快照自然过期重建，而不是写脚本批量转换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重放的工程现实\">重放的工程现实</h2><p>重放不只发生在加载单个聚合时，它在三个场景里都会大规模出现，每个都有自己的性能考量。<strong>聚合加载</strong>——最高频，靠快照优化，目标是把单次加载压在毫秒级。<strong>投影重建</strong>——把一个读模型从头重算，要重放该投影关心的全部历史事件，可能是几百万条，靠批量读取和并行处理提速（见 <a href=\"../modeling/projections-read-models\">投影与读模型</a>）。<strong>全量迁移/审计</strong>——把整个事件流重放以生成报告或迁移，通常离线跑。</p>\n<p>这三类重放对事件存储的读取模式要求不同：聚合加载要&quot;按 stream 快速点读&quot;，投影重建要&quot;按全局序高吞吐顺序扫描&quot;。一个设计良好的事件存储要同时服务好这两种读取，这也是 <a href=\"event-store-design\">事件存储设计</a> 里 stream 内顺序与全局序两个维度都要建索引的原因。还有一个容易忽视的点：重放期间事件流仍在被写入，投影重建追历史的同时新事件不断产生，要靠 catch-up 订阅&quot;先追历史再接实时&quot;的语义无缝衔接，避免漏掉重建窗口期内的新事件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>重放是事件溯源加载状态的根本动作（对 stream 折叠）；快照缓存某个中间折叠结果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，使加载只需重放增量。</li>\n<li>铁律：快照是缓存不是真相，可随时删除并从事件重算，重算结果必须与快照一致。</li>\n<li>触发策略有按事件数（最常用，如每 100 条）、按重放耗时（超 100ms 考虑）、按热度；快照可异步生成。</li>\n<li>快照必须记两个版本：事件 position（从哪读增量）和聚合结构版本（能否反序列化）；漏后者是常见坑。</li>\n<li>聚合结构演进时旧快照直接作废、退回全量重放重建——绝不&quot;迁移旧快照&quot;，那是把缓存当真相的反模式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>快照只是 fold 缓存的数学依据：见 <a href=\"../foundations/events-vs-state\">事件与状态的对偶</a></li>\n<li>投影重建为何与快照同哲学（皆可丢弃重算）：见 <a href=\"../modeling/projections-read-models\">投影与读模型</a></li>\n<li>事件演进难、快照演进易的对比根源：见 <a href=\"../modeling/event-design-versioning\">事件设计与版本演进</a></li>\n<li>检查点恢复与崩溃重放的通用机制：见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../database-transactions-concurrency/recovery-durability/checkpoint-recovery\">数据库事务与并发 · 检查点恢复</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"快照与重放","id":"快照与重放"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"何时拍快照","id":"何时拍快照"},{"level":2,"text":"快照与聚合演进","id":"快照与聚合演进"},{"level":2,"text":"重放的工程现实","id":"重放的工程现实"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"事件存储设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/event-sourcing-cqrs/infrastructure/event-store-design"},"next":{"title":"最终一致性与同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/event-sourcing-cqrs/infrastructure/eventual-consistency-sync"}}